--
Full gcc-16 <optional> transform through a preprocessed carrier
(tumbleweed g++ 16.2).  Fixed in three layers: the host-keyed builtin
token gate + the missing #reference flag on __add_rvalue_reference
(round 107), requires-clause atoms evaluated under the declaration's
parameter mapping (round 108), and empty argument-pack expansion in
requires-expression requirements (round 112, the silent _M_apply body
drop).  History of the diagnosis, including the symptom-gate drift
post-mortem, is in .kiro/decltype_tuple_apply_findings.md rounds
104-112.
